<title>USA: MPM Tech to buy U.S. Filter unit.</title>
<headline>MPM Tech to buy U.S. Filter unit.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MPM Technologies Inc on Wednesday said it plans to acquire United States Filter Corp's U.S. Filter/Engineered Systems unit, also known as its Oxidation Group.</p>
<p>The unit, based in in Schaumburg, Ill., specializes in the design, supply and service of air pollution control equipment for industrial and environmental customers worldwide.</p>
<p>MPM plans to build a core business around air pollution control systems and environmental remediation technologies. In a statement, MPM said additional acquisitions will be a focus through 1997 and 1998.</p>
</text>
